From a06784a68701cf42b27e724c71a090c122324a31 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Radhey Shyam Pandey <radhey.shyam.pandey@amd.com>
Date: Fri, 26 Sep 2025 12:23:26 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 124/190] Revert "usb: dwc3: xilinx: add shutdown callback"

commit 6f6dfe7cca6708cfdc1330ca2f486ea1d6ec974a from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

This reverts commit 9275ba525483bef6b059c7cadb949502552fa79b.

The USB DWC3 shutdown implementation causes issues on Versal platforms.
As a result, USB devices fail to enumerate after a reboot. This is due to
a failure in the D0 -> D3 power state transition triggered in the remove()
path.

To avoid power management regressions,  as a workaround revert it to
last working version.

Observed logs:
usb usb1: USB disconnect, device number 1
usb 1-1: USB disconnect, device number 2
xhci-hcd xhci-hcd.0.auto: USB bus 1 deregistered
ERR XPm_Ioctl: 0x1
ERR XPm_DevIoctl: 0x1
ALERT XPm_ProcessCmd: Error 0x1 while processing command 0x1000222
ALERT XPm_ProcessCmd: Err Code: 0x1

After reboot:
xilinx-vck190-20252:/home/petalinux# lsusb
Bus 001 Device 001: ID 1d6b:0002

Signed-off-by: Radhey Shyam Pandey <radhey.shyam.pandey@amd.com>
Message-ID: <20250926065326.2352923-1-radhey.shyam.pandey@amd.com>
State: not-upstreamable
Signed-off-by: Quanyang Wang <quanyang.wang@windriver.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-xilinx.c | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-xilinx.c b/drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-xilinx.c
index db653a51d4ce..ed1df80b5ef0 100644
--- a/drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-xilinx.c
+++ b/drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-xilinx.c
@@ -942,7 +942,6 @@ static const struct dev_pm_ops dwc3_xlnx_dev_pm_ops = {
 static struct platform_driver dwc3_xlnx_driver = {
 	.probe		= dwc3_xlnx_probe,
 	.remove_new	= dwc3_xlnx_remove,
-	.shutdown	= dwc3_xlnx_remove,
 	.driver		= {
 		.name		= "dwc3-xilinx",
 		.of_match_table	= dwc3_xlnx_of_match,
-- 
